  "editorial": {
    "name": "MingCute Icon",
    "descriptionZh": "MingCute 是一套开源图标库，网页上按 arrow、building、business 等类别浏览整套图标，另有 Figma 插件、Animation 与 PRO 等扩展样式。",
    "takeawayZh": "在 3324 个图标里搜一个，直接下 SVG，或从 Figma 插件里拖走。",
    "noteZh": "首屏右侧斜排着一整片等距视角的图标墙，蓝色、绿色、橙色三块斜向渐次亮起来，左边写着 'Carefully Designed Icon Library' 和一句 'MingCute is a set of simple and exquisite open-source icon library.'。往下是 All (3324) 的分类下拉、Search Icons... 输入框和 Collection (0) 按钮，再往下按 arrow、building、business 这样的分组铺图标卡，每张卡下面标着 align_arrow_down、arrow_left_circle 这种图标名。导航里 Animation、PRO、UI Kit、Weather、Github、Download、Store 一字排开，顶栏还挂着 'New launch! Figma plugin + 3 new styles!' 的上新条。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
